        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Capture boundary:&lt;/b&gt; Wireshark/TShark captures only loopback traffic generated by the local service and scenario harness.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Isolation:&lt;/b&gt; no physical adapter, router, employer network, or public scan is part of the lab.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Evidence:&lt;/b&gt; raw reports stay ignored; sanitized summaries and screenshots are committed." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#5d6d7e;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
